/E (Friedcat \(Jiang Xinyu \) was born in 1986 in Shaoyang, Hunan Province, China. Very few details of his childhood are known, but reasonable assumptions can be made. Shaoyang was a working class region. It is unlikely that his childhood was wealthy. It is likely, however, that his parents were strongly interested and motivated towards getting him the best education possible. He had enough raw intellectual ability to gain admittance to the First Middle School of Shaoyang, Hunan, but he would probably also require coaching, exam preparation and strong academic nurturing to succeed as he did.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
